@baseUrl = http://localhost:8083
@contentType = application/json

### Variables — fill after login (use the same token from user-service)
@accessToken = <paste_access_token_here>


### Calculate total before placing order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/total
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "items": [
    { "menu_item_id": 1, "name": "Burger", "quantity": 2, "price": 1500 },
    { "menu_item_id": 2, "name": "Fries",  "quantity": 1, "price": 500  }
  ]
}


### Create order
# @name createOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "restaurant_id": 1,
  "items": [
    { "menu_item_id": 1, "name": "Burger", "quantity": 2, "price": 1500 },
    { "menu_item_id": 2, "name": "Fries",  "quantity": 1, "price": 500  }
  ]
}


### Create order — empty items (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "restaurant_id": 1,
  "items": []
}


### Get order by ID
# @name getOrder
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Get order — not found (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### List my orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Get order history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/history
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Update order status (admin use)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "status": "delivered"
}


### Pay for order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "method": "card",
  "amount": 3500
}


### Pay — order not found (expect 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/99999/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "method": "card",
  "amount": 1000
}


### Cancel order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Cancel already cancelled (expect 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### No token (expect 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
